subsetdef: tier_T0 "match-string tier T0 (annotation build)"
subsetdef: tier_T1 "match-string tier T1 (annotation build)"
subsetdef: tier_T2 "match-string tier T2 (annotation build)"
ontology: eco
remark: matchable strings only; per-term tiers in subset tier_T0..T2
remark: obsolete stanzas retained for id resolution with their label
remark: moved to property_value retired_label, so no matcher reads it

